{"id":"x3wl4vxehcnpsv30oma50w4zc","title":"植物学是很好玩的","originalTitle":null,"summary":"今年秋冬的公选课《植物漫谈》中，师生互动越来越融洽，学生积极参与，通过观察和分享植物的故事，增强了对自然美的感知。课堂上，同学们对食虫植物的捕虫器进行了细致观察，发现这些结构实际上是叶片的变态或拟态。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=434526&do=blog&id=1561585"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T01:39:28.806Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T01:39:28.806Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":14,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}